    "title": "Aero Launches on Seven Chains as Aerodrome and Velodrome Merge",
    "summary": "The combined DEX, built on Dromos Labs' MetaDEX03, targets $121bn in monthly trading volume across Ethereum, Base, Robinhood Chain and four other networks.\nThe post Aero Launches on Seven Chains as Aerodrome and Velodrome Merge appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
