    "title": "Wirex appoints former Starling COO Julian Sawyer to board",
    "summary": "Wirex Limited, the UK headquartered payments provider, has appointed Julian Sawyer, co-founder and former Chief Operating Officer of Starling Bank, to the Board as an Independent Non-Executive Director.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.finextra.com/pressarticle/111639/wirex-appoints-former-starling-coo-julian-sawyer-to-board?utm_medium=rssfinextra&utm_source=finextrafeed",
    "source": "Finextra",
    "tags": [
      "Wirex",
      "Starling Bank",
      "Julian Sawyer",
      "United Kingdom"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-11-10T18:36:00.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-11-10T19:54:46.531Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "Wirex Limited, the UK-based payments provider, has appointed Julian Sawyer to its board of directors. Sawyer brings significant industry experience to the role, having previously served as the co-founder and Chief Operating Officer of Starling Bank. In his new position, he will serve as an Independent Non-Executive Director, supporting the company's ongoing growth and strategic development within the financial sector.",
    "content_ta": "இங்கிலாந்தை தளமாகக் கொண்ட பேமெண்ட்ஸ் நிறுவனமான Wirex, Julian Sawyer-ஐ தனது வார்டு இயக்குநராக நியமித்துள்ளது. Starling Bank-ன் இணை நிறுவனர் மற்றும் முன்னாள் தலைமை இயக்க அதிகாரியாக பணியாற்றிய Sawyer, இந்த பதவிக்கு மதிப்புமிக்க தொழில் அனுபவத்தை கொண்டு வருகிறார். இந்த புதிய பொறுப்பில், அவர் சுதந்திரமான நிர்வாக இயக்குநராகப் பணியாற்றி, நிதித் துறையில் நிறுவனத்தின் தொடர்ச்சியான வளர்ச்சிக்கு ஆதரவளிப்பார்.",
    "slug": "wirex-appoints-former-starling-coo-julian-sawyer-to-board"
  },
